{"ok":true,"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/AP/record/SWS_PER_00111","versions":[{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/AP/record/SWS_PER_00111@rel:R25-11#9014bbf3","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/AP/record/SWS_PER_00111","release":"R25-11","content":"function DeleteFile [SWS_PER_00111] Upstream: RS_PER_00001 , RS_PER_00004 , RS_AP_00119 , RS_AP_00120 , RS_ AP_00121, RS_AP_00127 , RS_AP_00128 , RS_AP_00129 , RS_AP_00135 , RS_AP_00139 , RS_AP_00159 ara::core::Result &lt; void &gt; DeleteFile ( ara::core::StringView fileName) noexcept; Deletes a file from this File Storage. This operation will fail with kResourceBusy when the file is currently open. Header-Datei #include \"ara/per/file_storage.h\" class mono Scope class ara::per::FileStorage class mono Exception-Sicherheit exception safe class mono Thread-Sicherheit thread-safe class mono Parameter (in) th Parameter th Beschreibung td fileName td File name of the file. May correspond to the PersistencyFile.file Name of a configured file. Rückgabewert th Typ th Beschreibung td ara::core::Result &lt; void &gt; td A Result of void. In case of an error, it contains any of the errors defined below, or a vendor specific error. Fehler th Fehlercode th Beschreibung td PerErrc ::kIllegalWriteAccess td rollback_semantics Returned if the File Storage is configured as read-only. td PerErrc ::kPhysicalStorageFailure td no_rollback_semantics Returned if access to the physical storage fails. td PerErrc ::kIntegrityCorrupted td rollback_semantics Returned if stored data cannot be written because the structural integrity is corrupted. td PerErrc ::kEncryptionFailed td rollback_semantics Returned if the encryption or decryption of stored data fails. td PerErrc ::kResourceBusy td rollback_semantics Returned if the file is open, or if RecoverFile or ResetFile with the same file name is currently being executed. td PerErrc ::kFileNotFound td rollback_semantics Returned if the provided file does not exist in the File Storage. td PerErrc ::kAuthenticationFailed td rollback_semantics Returned if calculating or checking the MAC of stored data fails.","meta":{"trigger_kind":"baseline_sync"},"recorded_at":"2026-09-30T16:43:34+00:00","text_key":"62e8c61bc978"}],"lifecycle":{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/AP/record/SWS_PER_00111","is_dropped":false,"first_active_release":"R25-11","last_active_release":"R25-11","dropped_in":[],"first_dropped_release":null,"absent_before":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11"],"platform_releases":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"latest_platform_release":"R25-11"},"element":{"kind":"function","name":"DeleteFile","module":"PER","cluster":"","page":"classes/cl_ara_per_FileStorage_29266b.html","doc_type":"SWS","ai":false,"first":"R25-11","last":"R25-11","changed":[],"distinct":1,"universe":"AP"},"evidence":{"figures":[],"snippets":[{"id":"SNIP_per_AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_P_P125_385","doc":"AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Persistency","p":125,"rel":["R23-11"],"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE (deterministic citation)","n":1,"x":"Specification of Persistency AUTOSAR AP R23-11 8.3.11.5 FileStorage::DeleteFile [SWS_PER_00111] Definition of API function ara::per::FileStorage::DeleteFile d","src":"snippet"},{"id":"SNIP_per_AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_P_P20_42","doc":"AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Persistency","p":20,"rel":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE (deterministic citation)","n":84,"x":"[SWS_PER_00042] [SWS_PER_00043] [SWS_PER_00044] [SWS_PER_00046] [SWS_PER_00047] [SWS_PER_00048] [SWS_PER_00049] [SWS_PER_00052] [SWS_PER_00107] [SWS_PER_00110] [SWS_PER_00111] [SWS_PER_00112] [SWS_PE…","src":"snippet"},{"id":"SNIP_per_AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_P_P21_45","doc":"AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Persistency","p":21,"rel":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"API_IMPLEMENTATION",